### ========================================
### 🚀 UI FEATURES - Controle de Páginas
### ========================================

### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = seu_token_aqui

### ========================================
### 1️⃣ SEED - Cadastrar TODAS as páginas do app
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/seed/mobile-app
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 2️⃣ Listar TODAS as features
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 3️⃣ Listar apenas páginas VISÍVEIS
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/pages/visible
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 4️⃣ Listar apenas features VISÍVEIS (todas)
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/visible
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 5️⃣ Buscar uma página específica
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.home
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 6️⃣ Buscar página de AI Assistant
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.ai_assistant
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 7️⃣ OCULTAR uma página (AI Assistant)
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.ai_assistant/visibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isVisible": false
}

### ========================================
### 8️⃣ MOSTRAR uma página (AI Assistant)
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.ai_assistant/visibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isVisible": true
}

### ========================================
### 9️⃣ OCULTAR Design System
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.ui_design_system/visibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isVisible": false
}

### ========================================
### 🔟 OCULTAR automaticamente páginas de DEV
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/hide-dev-pages
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### Listar por categoria - FREIGHT
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/category/FREIGHT
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### Listar por categoria - DASHBOARD
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/category/DASHBOARD
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### Listar por categoria - USERS
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/category/USERS
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### Listar por categoria - SETTINGS
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/category/SETTINGS
Content-Type: application/json

### ========================================
### 🎯 EXEMPLO COMPLETO: Configurar para produção
### ========================================

# 1. Cadastrar todas as páginas
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/seed/mobile-app

###

# 2. Ocultar páginas de desenvolvimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/hide-dev-pages

###

# 3. Ocultar features premium (se não tiver plano)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/page.ai_assistant/visibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isVisible": false
}

###

# 4. Verificar o que ficou visível
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui-features/pages/visible
